{"ID":"20240220132614-beemnmj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132614-beemnmj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132614-beemnmj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164753-wo8sv4n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164753-738o3iz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164753-738o3iz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:30,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:30\u0026#125;","title":"【甘草附子汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312164753-wo8sv4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-wo8sv4n","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百九十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-km9mo10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-km9mo10","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：风湿相搏，骨节烦疼，掣痛，不得屈伸，近之则痛剧，汗出，短气，小便不利，恶风不欲去衣被，或身微肿者，「甘草附子汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-jjpqc60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-jjpqc60","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位学会这一百九十条处方以后，从此痛风对你来说就很简单了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-m25jc57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-m25jc57","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“近之则痛剧”碰都不能碰，“汗出”痛的流汗，不是这个病会汗出，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痛到流汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。汗出，短气，小便不利，恶风不欲去衣被，或身微肿者，这个现象就是现在的痛风。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-vkh7qvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-vkh7qvy","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痛风的时候皮肤表面上红红的，肿肿的，摸上去是烫的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实际上里面是寒的，一定要用热药。甘草附子汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-tphvzrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-tphvzrk","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草附子汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-lk9mb9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-lk9mb9r","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草二两炙。附子二枚，炮去皮，破。白朮二两。桂枝四两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-fsjkxv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-fsjkxv3","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水六升，煮取三升，去滓，温服一升，日三服。初服得微汗则解，能食，汗止，复烦者，服五合；恐一升多者，宜服六七合为始。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-f46tfsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-f46tfsr","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“附子二枚，炮去皮，破”破就是打开。剂量很重要，炮附子八钱，桂枝六钱，白术三钱，白术剂量最少，再来是桂枝，最重是炮附子，两枚。你桂枝跟炮附子等量都可以，但是还是炮附子加重。这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子是去寒，桂枝去风，白术去湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。三味药各有各的功能，怕不能合在一起，所以加了炙甘草下去。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草能缓和各种药性。同时有强心的作用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，同时也好吃一点。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-vgbdka8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-vgbdka8","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草附子汤是经方里面最有名的治痛风的处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一剂就知。你如果说开出来炮附子两片，白术三分五分，桂枝五分八分，你这个不叫做甘草附子汤，变成吃下去牙齿不痛了，牙龈不痛了，但身体肌肉还是照样痛啊，你这个太轻了，只能刷牙漱口。不是方子不对，而是你处方剂量不够。外面很痛很热，里面是寒实，病人疼的任你摆布，只要你能把它治好，再难吃的药我都吃。开下去绝对不会有事的，放心大剂的用，不要怕。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-rjs0me5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-rjs0me5","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以前呢，这个药很好玩哦，以前他痛风是常常发作，比如现在一个月发作两次，吃了你的药以后痛去掉了，变成了一个月发作一次，再吃你的药变成两个月发作一次，然后三个月发作一次，一年发作一次...最后你怎么判断他好了呢，等到他不发作，你叫他喝火锅汤，火锅汤喝下去都没有痛代表绝对没有尿酸过高，就好了；火锅汤多少精华在里面，很灵的啊，没好的话一喝就开始痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-a4ix61p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-a4ix61p","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能食，汗止，他一服已经好很多了，能吃东西了，复烦者，又来一点烦。服五合，第二次就不要喝那么多了，因为已经去很多了。比如第一次喝一升，一碗。第二次只有五合，半碗而已，不要喝一升，减量喝。恐一升多者，宜服六七合为始，就是你喝半碗，慢慢减量下来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164753-738o3iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164753-738o3iz","updated":"20240312164753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看这个方多厉害，吃完就晓得了，但是剂量一定要对，手不能软。"}]}]}